#: waydroid_helper/controller/widgets/components/macro.py:685
#: waydroid_helper/controller/widgets/components/macro.py:713
msgctxt "Controller Widgets"
msgid "Macro"
msgstr "宏按键"

#: waydroid_helper/controller/widgets/components/macro.py:688
msgctxt "Controller Widgets"
msgid "Execute macro commands when triggered."
msgstr "触发时执行宏命令。"

#: waydroid_helper/controller/widgets/components/macro.py:746
msgctxt "Controller Widgets"
msgid "Macro Command"
msgstr "宏命令"

#: waydroid_helper/controller/widgets/components/macro.py:750
msgctxt "Controller Widgets"
msgid ""
"The macro commands to execute when triggered. Supported commands:\n"
"- key_press <key1,key2,...>: Press keys\n"
"- key_release <key1,key2,...>: Release keys\n"
"- key_switch <key1,key2,...>: Switch keys (toggle between press/release)\n"
"- click <x,y> [x1,y1] ...: Click at coordinates (combines press and "
"release)\n"
"- press <x,y> [x1,y1] ...: Press at coordinates (DOWN events only)\n"
"- release <x,y> [x1,y1] ...: Release at coordinates (UP events only)\n"
"- switch <x,y> [x1,y1] ...: Switch at coordinates (toggle between press/"
"release)\n"
"- toggle_group <command_group_1> | <command_group_2>: Toggle between two "
"command groups (use ';' to separate commands within a group)\n"
"- sleep <milliseconds>: Delay execution\n"
"- release_all: Release all currently pressed keys\n"
"- enter_staring: Enter staring/aiming mode\n"
"- exit_staring: Exit staring/aiming mode\n"
"- swipehold_radius <factor>: Set swipehold radius\n"
"- swipehold_radius_switch <factor>: Set swipehold radius and switch\n"
"- Use 'release_actions' to separate press and release commands\n"
"- Lines starting with # are comments\n"
"- Use 'mouse' as coordinate to use current cursor position"
msgstr ""
"触发时执行的宏命令。支持的命令：\n"
"- key_press <key1,key2,...>: 按下按键\n"
"- key_release <key1,key2,...>: 释放按键\n"
"- key_switch <key1,key2,...>: 切换按键状态（按下和释放之间切换）\n"
"- click <x,y> [x1,y1] ...: 点击坐标（组合按下和释放）\n"
"- press <x,y> [x1,y1] ...: 按下坐标（DOWN事件）\n"
"- release <x,y> [x1,y1] ...: 释放坐标（UP事件）\n"
"- switch <x,y> [x1,y1] ...: 切换坐标（按下和释放之间切换）\n"
"- toggle_group <command_group_1> | <command_group_2>: 在两个指令组直接切换，"
"使用 ';' 来分割指令\n"
"- sleep <milliseconds>: 延迟执行\n"
"- release_all: 释放所有当前按下的按键\n"
"- enter_staring: 进入瞄准模式\n"
"- exit_staring: 退出瞄准模式\n"
"- swipehold_radius <factor>: 设置滑动半径\n"
"- swipehold_radius_switch <factor>: 设置滑动半径并切换\n"
"- 使用'release_actions'分隔按下和释放命令\n"
"- 以#开头的行为注释\n"
"- 使用'mouse'作为坐标使用当前鼠标位置"

